{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Engineers: Fieldwork Pack</strong> brings you a collection of laboratory-themed cosmetic blocks, including modular Lab Desks, active Lab Experiments, a sealed Lab Vat, a storage Lab Freezer, sleek Lab  Doors, an O2/H2 Generator with visible electrolysis, compact H2 and O2 Tanks, Round Passages for bunker interiors, industrial Pipes, textured Decorative Floors, a Cargo Access Terminal, and an Exhaust Cap for ventilation. Perfect for building high-tech research facilities and scientific outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This content is not \u201cpay to win\u201d and the owner of the package has no advantage against other players. If you decide not to purchase the Fieldwork Pack, but you want to play with friends or other players who did buy Fieldwork Pack, you will still be able to join a multiplayer game or server with them and participate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab Desks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(6 blocks, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A collection of modular workstations perfect for laboratories and research outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Lab-Desk.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab Experiments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(3 blocks, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Essential for any scientific facility, these decorative blocks show signs of active experimentation and ongoing research efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Lab-Experiment.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab Vat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(1 block, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique variant of the Cryo Chamber block, this sealed containment unit preserves offline players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Vat-Lab.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab Freezer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(1 block, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A storage unit perfect for preserving samples and medical supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Freezer.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab  Doors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(2 blocks, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A slim glass door which provides secure access to various areas of your laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Lab-Doors.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab O2/H2 Generator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(1 block, L grid + 1 block, S grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This block generates oxygen and hydrogen with visible electrolysis equipment showcasing the process at work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-O2-H2-Generator.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab Small H2 Tank</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(1 block, L grid + 1 block, S grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Portable hydrogen storage for small-scale systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Lab-Hydrogen-tank.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab Small O2 Tank</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(1 block, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oxygen tanks suited for laboratories and support modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/205-DLC-L-Oxygen-Tank.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lab H2 Tank</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(1 block, S grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A high capacity hydrogen storage unit for Small Grids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Small-Hydrogen-Tank.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Round Passages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(6 blocks, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Segments of tunnels. Ideal for bunker interiors and modular labs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Round-Passages.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pipes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(7 blocks, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A set of decorative pipe blocks useful for adding detail to utility spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Pipes.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Decorative Floors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(3 blocks, L grid + 2 blocks, S grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A set of floor blocks which add panelling and texture to walkways, maintenance areas, and rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Floor.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cargo Access Terminal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(2 blocks, L grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secure access points for cargo management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206-DLC-Cargo-Terminal.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exhaust Cap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(1 block, L grid + 1 block, S grid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A low-profile exhaust vent with a variety of visual effects options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/extras/206---GIF---Exhaust-Cap.gif?t=1745863514\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601770?t=1745863514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/a9f2c6070b817aec5e3e7b23491c33d48bf822c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745863514","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/cde2e78f815d45d7552cfe597c98be25bfe51040/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745863514","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601770/cde2e78f815d45d7552cfe597c98be25bfe51040/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745863514","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Space Engineers: Fieldwork Pack</strong> brings you a collection of laboratory-themed cosmetic blocks, including modular Lab Desks, active Lab Experiments, a sealed Lab Vat, a storage Lab Freezer, sleek Lab  Doors, an O2/H2 Generator with visible electrolysis, compact H2 and O